<title>INDIA: India SKF 96/97 net up at 188 mln rupees.</title>
<headline>India SKF 96/97 net up at 188 mln rupees.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's SKF Bearings Ltd said on Tuesday it posted a net profit of 188 million rupees for the first six months of 1996/97 (April-March).  </p>
<p>A company official said total income advanced to 2.12 billion rupees against its year-ago figure of 1.86 billion.</p>
<p>The company did not give other details.</p>
<p>Shares of SKF Bearings were unchanged at 2,450 rupees at the Bombay Stock Exchange on Tuesday.</p>
<p>SKF Bearings is a 51 percent subsidiary of Swedish bearing manufacturer SKF AB.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
